# AntiMatter — LinkedIn Video Storyboard & Demo Guide

This storyboard is updated to include all the latest high-fidelity UI Blitz features. It is designed to be **mute-friendly, high-energy, and developer-focused** for social media and recruiter demos.

---

## ⚡ The Hero Features Highlighted

1. **Log Redirection & Flying Capsule Animation:** Clicking "Send Logs to AI" initiates a smooth flying animation (curved bezier path) that redirects traceback logs into the AI Chat Input.
2. **Offline Mode & Low-Token Settings:** Navigating settings to select local Ollama models and showing the query classifier running in a low-token layout.
3. **Episodic memory:** Viewing previous session insights in the "Memories" settings tab, allowing the agent to remember learnings across chat context resets.
4. **Command Palette (Ctrl+P):** Keyboard-driven VS Code style command bar for searching project files and execution shortcuts.
5. **Glassmorphic Observability Timeline:** Agent activity displaying running pulse pings, millisecond timestamp deltas between steps, and expand-on-click tool arguments/output code blocks.
6. **Token Budget & Odometer Ticker:** Top header displaying context window consumption percentage (green ➡️ yellow ➡️ red) and live odometer rolling token cost badge.
7. **Git Integration & Surgical Diffs:** Inline editor diffs, floating accept/reject controls positioned bottom-center (adjustable with terminal size), and the git panel tracking unstaged modifications.
8. **Interactive Mermaid Diagrams:** AI rendering live Mermaid.js flowcharts and state diagrams in message bubbles.
9. **Workspace Health Dashboard (Ctrl+Shift+D):** Floating live diagnostic dashboard with WebSocket indicators, syncing progress, model latencies, and session uptime.

