## 💡 Pro Tips for a Visual Demo

*   **Speed Up Loading States:** Agent LLM execution might take 10-20 seconds. Speed up the timeline loading footage by **3x to 5x** during video editing so that the pacing stays rapid and punchy.
*   **Show Off Hover States:** The new glassmorphic timeline cards and dashboard toggles look premium because of their micro-hover highlights. Make sure your recording mouse cursor stays visible and hovers briefly over options.
*   **Use High DPI Resolution:** Set Chrome/Edge zoom to **125% - 150%** before starting screen recording. This makes the Tokyo Night code layout look crisp and highly readable on mobile social feeds.